        "attribution": "Pfleiderer and Tokura made influential experimental contributions to identifying and establishing skyrmions in materials; Rosch contributed important theory of their emergent electrodynamics.",
        "maturity": "Skyrmions are well established experimentally across multiple systems, while proposed applications and some aspects of their control are still under development.",
